      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "As an interim measure, implementation of ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-724#icft=FCREPO-724"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " and ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-686#icft=FCREPO-686"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " will be implemented as methods in DefaultManagement (but will not involve changing the Management interface).  These methods will NOT be exposed as part of the main SOAP/REST APIs but will have other endpoints.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Part of this issue will involve migrating these methods (and other admin functions, eg reload policies) to the new Admin module/interface.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Code changes required to be noted here.  Code to be changed should be commented referencing this issue.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
