  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "At the committer call 2010-08-10 implementation of ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-724#icft=FCREPO-724"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " and ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-686#icft=FCREPO-686"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " raised the issue of where administrative methods such as migrating datastream control groups and recalculating managed datastream size should live, and how they should be exposed.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It was felt that these should not live in the main SOAP and REST APIs as they were likely to be more transitive and subject to change, therefore a separate module, with a separate API, should be implemented for these (and should be documented as being subject to change).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
